{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"广义上同调"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"广义上同调"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>广义上同调</strong> (generalized cohomology) 是空间范畴上满足与普通"},{"Local":{"url":"上同调","text":"上同调"}},{"Plain":"类似的性质的某种反变函子. 每个广义上同调都由一个"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"表示:\n$$\r\nE^*X = \\pi_{-*}[\\Sigma^\\infty_+ X,E].\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}